                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As the name implies, [i]Mein Kampf[/i] is full of unresolved struggles, but the biggest fight is just trying to make it work. The game is fundamentally broken: there isn't even a language option in the menus, forcing you to manually tweak .ini files just to get English translation that ends up being half-baked and missing from most of the interface anyway. On top of that, apparently advertised game modes are completely unavailable, and the Steam achievements are broken and won't trigger. Don't waste your time fighting with configuration files for an unfinished mess.",
